<title>USA: TABLE - Peoples Energy Corp Q3 June 30 net.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Peoples Energy Corp Q3 June 30 net.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.34		    $0.41</p>
<p> Net			 11,735		   14,247</p>
<p> Revs		     202,434		  248,500</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  34,988		   34,946</p>
<p>NOTE: Q3 1997 net decline reflects decreased gas deliveries due to  conservation and year-ago period's gain associated with the expiration  of gas storage contracts. These effects partially offset by decreased  pension expenses.</p>
<p>		     NINE MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $3.22		    $3.22</p>
<p> Net			112,484		  112,378</p>
<p> Revs		   1,157,567		1,064,662</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  34,980		   34,938</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Nine-month 1997 results include positive effect of decreased  pension costs, November 1995 rate increase, a rise in other operating  revenue and tax accrual adjustment, offset by decreased profit on  gas deliveries and year-ago gain on expiration of gas storage contracts.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
